--- query
MATCH (a:person)-[:knows]->(b:person)-[:knows]->(c:person), (a)-[:knows]->(c) WHERE a.ID<b.ID and b.ID<c.ID RETURN a.fName, b.fName, c.fName
--- expected
Alice|Bob|Carol
Alice|Bob|Dan
Alice|Carol|Dan
Bob|Carol|Dan
